  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "35734092",
      "title": "Deferring Data Fetching with defer()",
      "sourceHash": "04177349632af36cec4546d47762009e746815f3e165bf3d9e8ccc931cf9e1b2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 5.4,
          "en": "Now to come to an end for this module here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.4,
          "end": 7.98,
          "en": "I wanna introduce one last feature you should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.98,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "also be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 12.9,
          "en": "And that's a feature that allows you to defer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.9,
          "end": 15.33,
          "en": "when data is loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.33,
          "end": 16.533,
          "en": "But what does this mean?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.94,
          "end": 19.71,
          "en": "Well, to show you what it means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.71,
          "end": 24.15,
          "en": "let me go back to my backend code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.15,
          "end": 25.98,
          "en": "to routes events JS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.98,
          "end": 27.93,
          "en": "And here at the very top.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.93,
          "end": 30.03,
          "en": "This get route which is responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.03,
          "end": 33.39,
          "en": "for returning a list of all my events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.39,
          "end": 36.99,
          "en": "Here I wanna bring back a timeout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.99,
          "end": 38.34,
          "en": "And I wanna slow this down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.34,
          "end": 40.47,
          "en": "and make sure that my response",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.47,
          "end": 44.07,
          "en": "with the events is only sent after two seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.07,
          "end": 47.13,
          "en": "Now just as before, we should restart that backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.13,
          "end": 49.233,
          "en": "for these changes to have an effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.07,
          "end": 53.43,
          "en": "And now if we would go to another page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.43,
          "end": 55.53,
          "en": "and back to the events page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.53,
          "end": 59.28,
          "en": "you will see that it takes some time for this page to load.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.28,
          "end": 62.04,
          "en": "And we did discuss this earlier already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.04,
          "end": 65.16,
          "en": "and I did show you how you could show a loading indicator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.16,
          "end": 67.293,
          "en": "with help of the use navigation hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.46000000000001,
          "end": 70.68,
          "en": "But sometimes you wanna load this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.68,
          "end": 72.36,
          "en": "before the data is there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.36,
          "end": 74.43,
          "en": "and show parts of the page already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.43,
          "end": 76.62,
          "en": "until all the data is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 76.62,
          "end": 78.42,
          "en": "For example, here it would make sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.42,
          "end": 80.37,
          "en": "to show these buttons already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 80.37,
          "end": 83.1,
          "en": "the all events and new event buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.1,
          "end": 85.98,
          "en": "even if the list of events hasn't been loaded yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 85.98,
          "end": 88.05,
          "en": "But at the moment we don't see anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.05,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "until the events are there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 95.16,
          "en": "And that's where we can defer loading and tell React router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.16,
          "end": 99.47999999999999,
          "en": "that we actually wanna render a component already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.47999999999999,
          "end": 102.69,
          "en": "even though the data is not fully there yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.69,
          "end": 105.6,
          "en": "And that's exactly what we'll implement now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.6,
          "end": 107.72999999999999,
          "en": "For that, we can go to events JS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.72999999999999,
          "end": 111.50999999999999,
          "en": "which is where we are loading these events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 111.50999999999999,
          "end": 114.75,
          "en": "And in order to defer loading that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 114.75,
          "end": 117.18,
          "en": "what we need to do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.18,
          "end": 121.95,
          "en": "is we need to grab that code here and outsource it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.95,
          "end": 125.88,
          "en": "into a separate function, an async function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.88,
          "end": 129.54,
          "en": "which I'll name load events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 129.54,
          "end": 132,
          "en": "And then I put my code in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 132,
          "end": 134.1,
          "en": "So it's almost the same code as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.1,
          "end": 136.413,
          "en": "Just wrapped into a separate function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.55,
          "end": 140.73,
          "en": "I'm doing this because in the loader I now don't",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.73,
          "end": 144.15,
          "en": "want to await this promise here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.15,
          "end": 149.15,
          "en": "Instead here I can actually get rid of this async keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.34,
          "end": 152.85,
          "en": "and use a special function in this loader function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.85,
          "end": 156.96,
          "en": "The defer function which should be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 156.96,
          "end": 158.79,
          "en": "from react-router-dom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.79,
          "end": 160.53300000000002,
          "en": "This defer function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 162.48,
          "end": 165.15,
          "en": "Now defer is a function that must be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165.15,
          "end": 168.183,
          "en": "and Q defer we pass an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 169.44,
          "end": 171.42000000000002,
          "en": "Now in this object, we in the end, bundle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 171.42000000000002,
          "end": 173.76,
          "en": "all the different HTTP requests we might",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.76,
          "end": 175.44,
          "en": "have going on on this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 175.44,
          "end": 177.72,
          "en": "In this case it's only one request though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 177.72,
          "end": 179.703,
          "en": "The request for all my events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 180.66,
          "end": 183.33,
          "en": "I'll give that request a key of events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 183.33,
          "end": 186.27,
          "en": "For example, though that key is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.27,
          "end": 189.66,
          "en": "And then here I'll point at load events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.66,
          "end": 191.79,
          "en": "I'll actually not just point at it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 191.79,
          "end": 193.95,
          "en": "instead I will execute it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 193.95,
          "end": 196.47,
          "en": "So I add parentheses here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 196.47,
          "end": 198.96,
          "en": "So I execute the load events function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 198.96,
          "end": 202.32,
          "en": "and I stored a value returned by load events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 202.32,
          "end": 205.71,
          "en": "which is a promise, since this is a async function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 205.71,
          "end": 208.473,
          "en": "in this object under the events key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 210,
          "end": 211.74,
          "en": "Now we must have a promise here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.74,
          "end": 213.27,
          "en": "If we wouldn't have a promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 213.27,
          "end": 214.95,
          "en": "there would be nothing to defer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 214.95,
          "end": 216.45,
          "en": "because the idea behind defer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 216.45,
          "end": 219.63,
          "en": "is that we have a value that will eventually resolve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.63,
          "end": 223.05,
          "en": "to another value, which is the definition of a promise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 223.05,
          "end": 226.53,
          "en": "And that we wanna load a component and render a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.53,
          "end": 230.49,
          "en": "even though that future value isn't there yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 230.49,
          "end": 232.56,
          "en": "So load events returns a promise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 232.56,
          "end": 235.2,
          "en": "It must return a promise and it does.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.2,
          "end": 236.57999999999998,
          "en": "And we store that promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 236.57999999999998,
          "end": 238.74,
          "en": "under the events key in this object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 238.74,
          "end": 240.363,
          "en": "which we pass to defer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 241.53,
          "end": 245.16,
          "en": "And it's now this value returned by defer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 245.16,
          "end": 247.293,
          "en": "which we return in our loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 248.64,
          "end": 251.85,
          "en": "Now this is not everything we have to do though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 251.85,
          "end": 255.03,
          "en": "Instead now, as our next step, we have to go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 255.03,
          "end": 258.99,
          "en": "to the component where we want to use the deferred data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 258.99,
          "end": 261.81,
          "en": "and we still use use loader data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 261.81,
          "end": 262.95,
          "en": "We still do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 262.95,
          "end": 266.01,
          "en": "But this data will now actually be an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 266.01,
          "end": 270.48,
          "en": "that gives us access to these deferred value keys here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 270.48,
          "end": 272.523,
          "en": "So to events, in my case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 273.51,
          "end": 275.88,
          "en": "And here in this component we now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 275.88,
          "end": 279.65999999999997,
          "en": "don't directly render the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 279.65999999999997,
          "end": 282.93,
          "en": "or the JSX code that needs our data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 282.93,
          "end": 284.82,
          "en": "Instead what we do in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 284.82,
          "end": 289.65,
          "en": "is we return another component provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 289.65,
          "end": 293.523,
          "en": "by react-router-dom and that's the await component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 295.17,
          "end": 297.093,
          "en": "So we render await here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 299.52,
          "end": 303.48,
          "en": "And await has a special resolve prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 303.48,
          "end": 307.863,
          "en": "which wants one of our deferred values as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 308.88,
          "end": 311.76,
          "en": "So here on this data object we know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 311.76,
          "end": 316.02,
          "en": "that we have an events key because that's what we set here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 316.02,
          "end": 319.38,
          "en": "So this data object here will have the keys we set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 319.38,
          "end": 322.2,
          "en": "in this object that we pass to defer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 322.2,
          "end": 324.09,
          "en": "And that events key will,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 324.09,
          "end": 326.493,
          "en": "in the end, hold a promise as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 327.39,
          "end": 329.85,
          "en": "So it's kind of that promise which we wanna pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 329.85,
          "end": 332.913,
          "en": "to this resolve value of the await component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 334.44,
          "end": 337.26,
          "en": "So here I'll actually use object de structuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 337.26,
          "end": 339.36,
          "en": "to get my events key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 339.36,
          "end": 342.513,
          "en": "and pass this to resolve here, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 344.074,
          "end": 346.44,
          "en": "Now that await component will wait",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 346.44,
          "end": 348.72,
          "en": "for that data to be there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 348.72,
          "end": 351.21,
          "en": "And then between the opening and closing tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 351.21,
          "end": 353.19,
          "en": "we output a dynamic value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 353.19,
          "end": 355.62,
          "en": "which must be a function that will be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 355.62,
          "end": 358.56,
          "en": "by a React router once that data is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 358.56,
          "end": 360.63,
          "en": "So once that promise resolved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 360.63,
          "end": 362.403,
          "en": "Once we have that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 363.9,
          "end": 366.84,
          "en": "So here we, therefore, get our events in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 366.84,
          "end": 370.11,
          "en": "Our loaded events if we want to call it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 370.11,
          "end": 372.75,
          "en": "Again, this function will be called by React router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 372.75,
          "end": 374.43,
          "en": "once the data is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 374.43,
          "end": 376.2,
          "en": "And it's therefore now here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 376.2,
          "end": 378.51,
          "en": "where we wanna output our events list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 378.51,
          "end": 383.51,
          "en": "and pass these loaded events as a value for the events prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 385.14,
          "end": 388.98,
          "en": "Now, as a last step, we have to add another component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 388.98,
          "end": 391.92,
          "en": "that must be wrapped around the await component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 391.92,
          "end": 394.02,
          "en": "And that's the suspense component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 394.02,
          "end": 396.09000000000003,
          "en": "which is imported from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 396.09000000000003,
          "end": 399.033,
          "en": "So not from React router but from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 400.08,
          "end": 402.42,
          "en": "The suspense component is a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
